0134_withheld_too_large — NOT CARRIED AS A STEP: THE DEVICE COLUMN HAS NO CHECK.

The shared entry widens the `message_bodies_withheld_reason` CHECK by one member, `too_large`.
The SQLite twin of `message_bodies.withheld_reason` is a plain `text` column with no CHECK
(`0001_baseline.sql`), so a device store already holds the new member and there is nothing to
rebuild or change.
